<title>HUNGARY: TENNIS-COETZER BEATS APPELMANS IN BUDAPEST OPEN WOMEN'S FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COETZER BEATS APPELMANS IN BUDAPEST OPEN WOMEN'S FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final result in the $107,500 Budapest Women's Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-1 6-3</p>
</text>
